assistant_prompt_template:
I am a buyer in Lebanon. {buyer_text}

Please find where I can buy this now. My fixed requirements: {fixed_requirements}

For up to three offers, give the retailer and its product page link, the exact configuration, the condition, the price and currency, whether it is in stock now, the delivery or pickup cost to {destination}, any other charges, the total I would pay, and the warranty. Say clearly which of these facts you could not verify. Do not guess missing costs.
